@startuml
concise "LR" as LR
concise "ST" as ST
robust "RB" as RB #lightblue

LR is AtPlace #palegreen
ST is AtLoad #gray
RB is Idle

@LR
0 is Lowering
100 is Lowered #pink
350 is Releasing

@ST
200 is Moving
300 is {-}
400 is Done

@RB
150 is Busy #yellow
250 is {hidden}
450 is Idle
@enduml
